<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Application non deployee</title>
  <style>
    body { margin:0; min-height:100vh; display:grid; place-items:center;
           background:#f4f5f7; color:#172b4d;
           font:15px/1.6 -apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; }
    .card { max-width:520px; padding:2rem 2.2rem; background:#fff; border-radius:10px;
            box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(9,30,66,.25); }
    h1 { margin:0 0 .6rem; font-size:1.25rem; }
    p { margin:.5rem 0; color:#42526e; }
    code { background:#f4f5f7; border-radius:4px; padding:.15rem .4rem;
           font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace; font-size:.9em; }
    .meta { margin-top:1.2rem; padding-top:1rem; border-top:1px solid #dfe1e6;
            font-size:.8rem; color:#6b778c; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>NGINX repond, l'application n'est pas encore deployee</h1>
    <p>
      Le serveur web du noeud <strong>{{ inventory_hostname }}</strong> fonctionne,
      mais aucun pod ne repond derriere le NodePort
      <code>{{ app_nodeport }}</code> du cluster.
    </p>
    <p>Deploiement de l'application :</p>
    <p><code>kubectl apply -k k8s/</code> &nbsp;ou&nbsp; lancer le pipeline Jenkins.</p>
    <div class="meta">
      Projet {{ project_name }} &middot; reverse proxy vers
      {{ nginx_upstream_host }}:{{ app_nodeport }}
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
